      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}: just tried it in a normal drive and found the actual issue.\n\nit wasn't onedrive but it is the length of file/path names\n\n(after actually looking at the log not just at the cut of preview at the bottom which cuts of at the space, hence my suspicion of the space not working)\n\nattached is the log file, i tried normal backup, one extremely long folder name and many folders with a in total long path.\n\nboth tries with a long folder structure fail at the same file, the one without one failes at a especially long file.\n\na extreme short project name and folder structure successfully backs up.\n\nthis time i'll give you the actual logfile: https://eslar.zone/unindexed/20221210T185616-log.txt\n\nOS: Windows 10 22h2 (19045.2311)",
